  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/misc3/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Review 2026-11-01 at dev 100b6fbb6e: fixture binds types.add*(var seq[Tweets]; Tweet) at 0.85 for a field chain (h.photos.add p), an inferred local (var xs = newSeq[Photo]()), a module-level var, and result.add(t) where the second argument decides; the declared-type control goes external. The self-call shape (timeline.add inside add*) never reaches run output: deduplicate_edges(remove_self_loops=True) at cli.py:13189 drops it. MECHANISM: nim first-argument type lookup limited to proc-local declarations and to the first argument. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-bivab,WI-losaf."  # 8f11
